{
  "$schema": "https://aka.ms/codetour-schema",
  "title": "Project import: from a GitHub branch to an active Snapshot",
  "description": "How a repository commit becomes an active Snapshot: the import is queued, its files are fetched through the Source port, scanned for language and entrypoints, and stored.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "file": "janus-go/internal/app/imports.go",
      "line": 65,
      "title": "An import is requested",
      "description": "`func (i *Imports) Request` records the import as queued and starts it. The HTTP request returns before any files are fetched."
    },
    {
      "file": "janus-go/internal/app/imports.go",
      "line": 410,
      "title": "The import runs",
      "description": "`func (i *Imports) run` fetches the commit, scans it, and stores a Staging Snapshot, then completes it."
    },
    {
      "file": "janus-go/internal/app/ports.go",
      "line": 146,
      "title": "The Source port",
      "description": "`type Source interface` opens a repository at a commit and lists its files. The core never calls git or GitHub directly."
    },
    {
      "file": "janus-go/internal/adapters/gitsource/git.go",
      "line": 42,
      "title": "The real Source adapter",
      "description": "`func New() *Git` returns the adapter that fetches the commit over git."
    },
    {
      "file": "janus-go/internal/domain/scan/scan.go",
      "line": 67,
      "title": "The scan is pure",
      "description": "`func Files` picks the language with the most files and lists entrypoint candidates. It runs no repository code."
    },
    {
      "file": "janus-go/internal/adapters/sqlstore/jobs.go",
      "line": 50,
      "title": "The Staging Snapshot is kept",
      "description": "`func (s *Store) BeginSnapshot` records the Staging Snapshot before any file is written, so a restart can resume it."
    },
    {
      "file": "janus-go/internal/app/imports.go",
      "line": 156,
      "title": "Resuming after a restart",
      "description": "`func (i *Imports) Resume` restarts the imports that a shutdown interrupted. See the job resume tour for the rest."
    }
  ]
}
